ered with a colorful cast of characters. Some think you’re cool, some are determined to beat you, and others might be from the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards, discover mysteries, and battle other competitors in the single-player campaign... Or just enjoy the view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515000/extras/3b915425ca6affd125625f07fbef54bc.poster.avif?t=1774945285\" width=622 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515000/extras/3b915425ca6affd125625f07fbef54bc.webm?t=1774945285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515000/extras/3b915425ca6affd125625f07fbef54bc.mp4?t=1774945285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515000/extras/7ebe3f43e55bb902b9493cd7907b34f9.webp?t=1774945285\" width=600 height=45 /></span>Take your cards online and compete in both casual and ranked matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends, make rivals, make profit, and have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515000/extras/df79556e56f0470bd19f1bb3475ad71a.poster.avif?t=1774945285\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515000/extras/df79556e56f0470bd19f1bb3475ad71a.webm?t=1774945285\" type=\"vi